        "@value": "by deleting subsection (2)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 18 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1) Every licensed offshore bank shall, at such frequency as may be specified by the Bank from time to time, submit to the Bank a statement showing the assets and liabilities of the licensed offshore bank in relation to its offshore banking business in the Federal Territory of Labuan.\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1A) A statement to be submitted under subsection (1) shall include— (a) a statement specifying the total amount of credit facilities granted by the licensed offshore bank to such customers of the licensed offshore bank as may be as specified by the Bank; (b) a statement specifying the class, category or description of credit facilities given and the business or industry in which the customers of the licensed offshore bank are involved; (c) a statement showing that the licensed offshore bank has complied with the requirements imposed upon it by section 11; and (d) such other statements, information, documents, statistics or returns as the Bank may specify.\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(2A) Notwithstanding subsection (2), the Bank may, if it deems expedient, disclose information obtained by it from a licensed offshore bank pursuant to the provisions of this Act to the home monetary authority of the licensed offshore bank.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "23 the following section: \" 23. (1) The Bank or the home monetary authority if so approved by the Bank may from time to time examine and inspect, under conditions of secrecy, the books or other documents, accounts and transactions of any licensed offshore bank and any office outside Malaysia of a licensed offshore bank for the purposes of verifying the submissions of such licensed offshore bank under sections 17 and 18. (2) The Bank may from time to time request the internal auditors or approved auditor of a licensed offshore bank to verify the accuracy of the submissions of such licensed offshore bank under sections 17 and 18. (3) Nothing in this section shall authorise the Bank, or the home monetary authority to inquire specifically into the identity, accounts or affairs of any particular customer of the licensed offshore bank.\". 8 Bill"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 25(4) of the principal Act is amended by"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "substituting for the words \"Federal Consolidated Fund\" 25. the words \"Fund established under section 29 of the Labuan Offshore Financial Services Act 1996\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/54/eng@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
